    "bbox": [
      71.04,
      427.2,
      297.65,
      485.27
    ],
    "text": "I, hereby give notice, under Sub-section (1) of Section 7 ofthe Land Acquisition Act, as amended by the LandAcquisition (Amendment) Act, No. 28 of 1964, that theGovernment intends to acquire the lands/servitudedescribed in the Schedule given below for a public purpose:",
