      511.2,
      297.72,
      593.27
    ],
    "text": "Allotment of land in extent about 0.0766 Hectaredepicted in Preliminary Plan No. Ke/3626 dated 11/10/2018prepared by Surveyor General situated in the villages ofKobbewela in 71 Kobbewela Grama Niladhari Divisionsubdivision of Kandupita Pattuwa North in the DivisionalSecretary's Division of Galigamuwa in the District of Kegallein Sabaragamuva Province.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
