      607.2,
      297.49,
      653.27
    ],
    "text": "01. Lot No. 01Name of the Land: Kandahena; Name of the Claimant:S. M. Nimal Karunathilaka, No. 569/108, BandaranayakePlace, Kalagedihena, Thihariya; Extent: 0.0007 Hectare.",
